  "contracts": {
    "identity": "Stable scaleId/outcomeId lookup with explicit value/rankIndex/luckyMatchNumber. Freeze version and mapping in every actual pool; never parse captions, source-sector angles or ordering at runtime.",
    "zero": "Noob is an actual zero-valued result. It is not None, an empty inventory, a skipped draw, a missing binding or an automatic funny-result tag.",
    "probability": "Random stat/mastery outcomes use conditional lore5%..25%. Explicit maximum guarantee skips RNG: God all-owned shared Power Mastery9, Lich Durability9. Equalizer/guards unchanged; old saved plans replay original mode.",
    "units": "Main-stat and mastery modifiers add numeric score points. Raw labels/indices are explicit0..9; finalized signed mastery scores may lie outside this raw label range.",
    "bounds": "Raw wheel outcomes remain0..9. Final scores for all five stats and both masteries may be negative or exceed9; no numeric cap/floor.",
    "powerTier": "Intrinsic Power Tier 1..5 is separate from 0..9 Power Mastery.",
    "labels": "A high stat label does not grant a separate power. In particular Durability Regenerative is score 9, not an automatic regeneration power acquisition.",
    "history": "Raw source evidence retains Darwizzy. New project invocations use Noob and this mapping; old committed journals keep original outcomes, labels, mappings, odds and effects."
  },
