    "display": "Use the mapped label for final0..9. Above9, display that stat's label at9 plus the exact excess (Power Mastery12 = Omnipotent+3). Below0, display Noob plus the signed deficit (-2 = Noob-2). Keep the exact signed number internally; raw spin labels and numeric mechanics do not change.",
